  "boundary": "This plan establishes a fail-closed Energy evidence collection control for the retained V1.7.1 energy-behavior lane. Because no approved GoreeCloud numeric energy ceiling exists, the protocol records direct or documented energy/power measurements and controlled comparative phases but does not automatically decide acceptance. Battery percentage delta, CPU/GPU utilization, thermal state, CI, emulators, templates, and synthetic self-tests cannot substitute for direct Energy evidence. A separately governed review must determine whether the measured behavior satisfies the applicable motion-efficiency standard, and the lane still separately requires Device evidence."
